<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bristol-Myers upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bristol-Myers upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Bristol-Myers Squibb Co to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Tuesday at 106-7/8.</p>
</text>
